<div class="encounter-shell"><header class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Random side activation</p><h1>Encounter · Round {{round}}</h1></div>{{#if isGM}}{{#unless hasCombat}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="create">Create from selected tokens</button>{{else}}{{#unless started}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="start">Start combat</button>{{else}}{{#if active}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="end">End activation</button>{{else}}{{#if complete}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="round">End round / next round</button>{{else}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="draw">Draw side</button>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/unless}}{{/unless}}{{/if}}</header><div class="bag-row">{{#each bag}}<span class="tag">{{side}} · {{count}} eligible</span>{{/each}}</div>{{#if side}}<p class="notice"><b>{{side}}</b>: choose an unactivated eligible combatant.</p>{{/if}}<div class="encounter-list">{{#each rows}}<article class="combatant-row {{#if active}}active{{/if}} {{#if activated}}activated{{/if}}"><img src="{{img}}" alt=""><div><button type="button" class="text-button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="sheet" data-id="{{id}}">{{name}}</button><small>{{side}}{{#if hidden}} · Hidden{{/if}} {{#if activated}} · Activated{{/if}} {{#unless eligible}} · Unable to act{{/unless}}</small></div><div class="combatant-resources"><span>{{combat.actionsRemaining}} A</span><span>{{combat.wounds}} W</span><span>{{combat.pressure}} P</span><span>{{#if combat.reactionAvailable}}1 R{{else}}0 R{{/if}}</span></div><div class="row-actions">{{#if selectable}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="activate" data-id="{{id}}">Activate</button>{{/if}}{{#if reserved}}{{#if owner}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="shot" data-id="{{id}}">Trigger {{combat.overwatch.kind}}</button>{{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if ../isGM}}{{#unless ../started}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="side" data-id="{{id}}">Side</button>{{/unless}}{{#if ../started}}{{#unless ../active}}{{#unless activated}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="activate" data-id="{{id}}" data-ambush="true">Ambush</button>{{/unless}}{{/unless}}{{/if}}{{/if}}</div></article>{{else}}<p>Add combatants with the native Token HUD or create an encounter from selected tokens.</p>{{/each}}</div><footer><p>One token per eligible combatant. The drawn side chooses who acts. Down combatants forfeit their unused activation. Core Combat controls use this same encounter.</p></footer></div>
